LOCATION:Emeritus Plaza - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:World Languages Fair
DESCRIPTION:Santa Rosa Junior College's World Languages Department invite
 s you to our Seventh Annual World Languages Fair on Thursday\, April 30\,
  2026 from 11 am to 1 pm!  There will be food\, music\, and activities.  
 The fair will be held at Emeritus Plaza\, the grassy area between Emeritu
 s and Plover Halls\, north of Elliott Ave on the Santa Rosa campus.  ASL 
 interpreting will be provided\, and everyone is welcome!  For more inform
 ation\, visit the website here! (https://languages.santarosa.edu/world-la
 nguages-fair)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Santa Rosa Junior College's World Langu
 ages Department invites you to our Seventh Annual World Languages Fair on
  Thursday\, April 30\, 2026 from 11 am to 1 pm!</p><p>  There will be foo
 d\, music\, and activities.</p><p>  The fair will be held at Emeritus Pla
 za\, the grassy area between Emeritus and Plover Halls\, north of Elliott
  Ave on the Santa Rosa campus.</p><p>  ASL interpreting will be provided\
 , and everyone is welcome!</p><p>  For more information\, <a href="https:
 //languages.santarosa.edu/world-languages-fair" target="_blank" rel="noop
 ener">visit the website here!</a></p>
