BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260430T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260430T180000
LOCATION:Santa Rosa Lindley Center\, Room 131
SUMMARY:Chat with Mark Cavagnero
DESCRIPTION:Mark Cavagnero\, FAIA\, founded Mark Cavagnero Associates in 
 1988 and has guided its growth into a design-centered practice serving cl
 ients internationally. As the founding principal of the firm\, he brings 
 over three decades of expertise in architecture and has been recognized f
 or his holistic design approach to various building types\, from educatio
 n\, museums\, civic buildings\, theaters\, and residential buildings. Mar
 k's work has been recognized with over 200 major design awards from inter
 national\, national\, state\, and local organizations\, and he was person
 ally honored with the 2015 lifetime achievement Maybeck Award\, 2012 Firm
  of the Year Award\, and 2010 Distinguished Practice Award from AIA Calif
 ornia.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Mark Cavagnero\, FAIA\, founded Mark Ca
 vagnero Associates in 1988 and has guided its growth into a design-center
 ed practice serving clients internationally. As the founding principal of
  the firm\, he brings over three decades of expertise in architecture and
  has been recognized for his holistic design approach to various building
  types\, from education\, museums\, civic buildings\, theaters\, and resi
 dential buildings. Mark's work has been recognized with over 200 major de
 sign awards from international\, national\, state\, and local organizatio
 ns\, and he was personally honored with the 2015 lifetime achievement May
 beck Award\, 2012 Firm of the Year Award\, and 2010 Distinguished Practic
 e Award from AIA California.</p>
UID:20260501T000000Z-18635@calendar.santarosa.edu
DTSTAMP:20260429T143233Z
