LOCATION:Mystic Theatre\, Petaluma\, CA
SUMMARY:Film Fest Petaluma
DESCRIPTION:Film Fest Petaluma\, now in its 18th edition\, is a day-long 
 festival at the historic Mystic Theatre in downtown Petaluma showcasing a
 cclaimed animated and live-action short films from around the world. The 
 event features four different programs all with filmmaker Q&amp\;As begin
 ning at 12pm\, 3pm\, 7pm\, and 9:45pm. Guests can make a day of the fest 
 with a $50 Shorts Pass or purchase tickets to individual shows.Visit thei
 r website for the program line-up and tickets here. (https://petalumafilm
 alliance.org/film-fest-2026/)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Film Fest Petaluma\, now in its 18th ed
 ition\, is a day-long festival at the historic Mystic Theatre in downtown
  Petaluma showcasing acclaimed animated and live-action short films from 
 around the world. The event features four different programs all with fil
 mmaker Q&amp\;As beginning at 12pm\, 3pm\, 7pm\, and 9:45pm. Guests can m
 ake a day of the fest with a $50 Shorts Pass or purchase tickets to indiv
 idual shows.</p><p><a href="https://petalumafilmalliance.org/film-fest-20
 26/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit their website for the program l
 ine-up and tickets here.</a></p>
