X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260502T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260502T190000
LOCATION:Student Engagement Center (Building 500) - Petaluma Campus
SUMMARY:Lavender Prom
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the end of the academic year and make unforget
 table memories at a dance hosted by Queer Resource Center\, Petaluma feat
 uring DJ and Drag Show.  Lavender Prom 2026 is an event by Queer Resource
  Center Petaluma where students and community can come and enjoy a night 
 of dancing to cap off the end of the academic year!  There will be a DJ a
 nd a special drag performer guest to keep the energy going throughout the
  night!Visit SRJC's Petaluma Intercultural Center website here! (https://
 petaluma.santarosa.edu/petaluma-intercultural-center)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Come celebrate the end of the academic 
 year and make unforgettable memories at a dance hosted by Queer Resource 
 Center\, Petaluma featuring DJ and Drag Show.</p><p>  Lavender Prom 2026 
 is an event by Queer Resource Center Petaluma where students and communit
 y can come and enjoy a night of dancing to cap off the end of the academi
 c year!</p><p>  There will be a DJ and a special drag performer guest to 
 keep the energy going throughout the night!</p><p><a href="https://petalu
 ma.santarosa.edu/petaluma-intercultural-center" target="_blank" rel="noop
 ener">Visit SRJC's Petaluma Intercultural Center website here!</a></p>
