 , and achievements this year!  Bring your friends &amp\; family—everyon
 e is welcome!  There will be Sashing\, Arts\, Crafts\, and Food!  Locatio
 n: Santa Rosa Campus\, Graduation lawn between the Bookstore and Burbank 
