DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260515T210000
LOCATION:Burbank Auditorium - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:SRJC Orchestra Concert: Take Flight
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to soar with beautiful music at the SRJC Orchestra'
 s Take Flight concert! The music will be enhanced by projections of stunn
 ing photos of birds by SRJC student Mary McAllister. Joining the performa
 nce will be the Santa Rosa Symphony's Aspirante Youth Orchestra who will 
 perform on the first half of the program. For the grand finale\, the two 
 orchestras will join forces to perform Stravinsky's exciting Danse Infern
 ale\, Berceuse and Finale from his Firebird Suite. Don't miss this unique
  and awe-inspiring concert!  Tickets: $6 - $12Buy tickets here! (https://
 www.eventbrite.com/e/srjc-orchestra-concert-take-flight-tickets-198595789
 5526)View the music department's event list here. (https://music.santaros
 a.edu/events)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Get ready to soar with beautiful music 
 at the SRJC Orchestra's Take Flight concert! The music will be enhanced b
 y projections of stunning photos of birds by SRJC student Mary McAllister
 . Joining the performance will be the Santa Rosa Symphony's Aspirante You
 th Orchestra who will perform on the first half of the program. For the g
 rand finale\, the two orchestras will join forces to perform Stravinsky's
  exciting Danse Infernale\, Berceuse and Finale from his Firebird Suite. 
 Don't miss this unique and awe-inspiring concert!</p><p>  Tickets: $6 - $
 12</p><p><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/srjc-orchestra-concert-tak
 e-flight-tickets-1985957895526" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy ticket
 s here!</a></p><p><a href="https://music.santarosa.edu/events" target="_b
 lank" rel="noopener">View the music department's event list here.</a></p>
