LOCATION:Burbank Auditorium - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:SRJC Bands: Pandora's Box
DESCRIPTION:Symphonic Band &amp\; Jazz Band take a critical look at what 
 humans are doing to our world. Feat. Video Projections\, Erik Johnson &am
 p\; Jazz Mirage.  The SRJC Symphonic Band and Jazz Band take a critical l
 ook at what humans are doing to our world.  Who are we are a country? How
  do we get along? Is there room for everybody?  The environmental take on
  pandora's box. What are we doing to our planet?  Gun violence and racism
 . Are we able to come together as community?  We explore all this in more
  in a 1-of-a-kind concert with Video Projections from Nancy Hayashibara.B
 uy tickets here! (https://www.eventbrite.com/e/srjc-bands-pandoras-box-wv
 ideo-projections-erik-johnson-jazz-mirage-tickets-1986100939374)&#160\;Vi
 ew the music department's events list here. (https://music.santarosa.edu/
 events)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Symphonic Band &amp\; Jazz Band take a 
 critical look at what humans are doing to our world. Feat. Video Projecti
 ons\, Erik Johnson &amp\; Jazz Mirage.</p><p>  The SRJC Symphonic Band an
 d Jazz Band take a critical look at what humans are doing to our world.</
 p><p>  Who are we are a country? How do we get along? Is there room for e
 verybody?</p><p>  The environmental take on pandora's box. What are we do
 ing to our planet?</p><p>  Gun violence and racism. Are we able to come t
 ogether as community?</p><p>  We explore all this in more in a 1-of-a-kin
 d concert with Video Projections from Nancy Hayashibara.</p><p><a href="h
 ttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/srjc-bands-pandoras-box-wvideo-projections-er
 ik-johnson-jazz-mirage-tickets-1986100939374" target="_blank" rel="noopen
 er">Buy tickets here!</a>&#160\;</p><p><a href="https://music.santarosa.e
 du/events" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View the music department's eve
 nts list here.</a></p>
